  "objectives": [
    "自然回應點名。",
    "使用 yes/no 簡答。",
    "以短句回答已知課堂資訊。"
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S012_SEC_1",
      "title": "點名回應表示在場",
      "content": "Here、Present 是在場，不需重複長自我介紹。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S012_SEC_2",
      "title": "是非簡答保留助動詞",
      "content": "Are you ready? → Yes, I am；Did you finish? → Yes, I did。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S012_SEC_3",
      "title": "資訊問句答所問",
      "content": "Which page? → Page 12；Who is absent? → Ben。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S012_SEC_4",
      "title": "不知道也可誠實回應",
      "content": "I'm not sure. Could you explain? 比亂猜更適當。"
    }
  ],
  "workedExamples": [
